{"id":"6390c94372c95f6af33a884336feee151d5c1deb","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243540","title":"最近发现，用 Ai 制作的公众号封面图的推文会被限流！有什么办法解决吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"liKeYunKeji","excerpt":"程序员 - @liKeYunKeji - 相当明显的限流！![image]( https://p0.ssl.qhimg.com/t11b673bcd632fcbe3dce259f3e.png)有什么能够让 ai 图不那么容易被","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>相当明显的限流！</p>\n<p><img alt=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://p0.ssl.qhimg.com/t11b673bcd632fcbe3dce259f3e.png\"></p>\n<p>有什么能够让 ai 图不那么容易被识别的方法吗？或者对图片进行去隐形水印？</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/限流\"><li></li> 限流</a><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/封面\"><li></li> 封面</a></P><p><span>20 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-21 14:22:49 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18108862\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8e95/1303/720304_normal.png?m=1746694605\" alt=\"Lexin914\" data-uid=\"720304\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Lexin914\">Lexin914</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 10:41:27 +08:00\">19h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国内有法规，ai 生成的图片 exif 元数据都加了特定的字段。<br>可以再过一道其他图片编辑器 或 让 ai 专门写个脚本清理这个。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18108917\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0443e8f3554c36f8a79fb68b57b5f89d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yulgang\" data-uid=\"66853\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yulgang\">yulgang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 10:47:28 +08:00\">19h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>对 ai 的图重新截图另存后上传截图看看</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18109485\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f2a1/3eea/10886_normal.png?m=1743861901\" alt=\"gsc\" data-uid=\"10886\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gsc\">gsc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 11:57:09 +08:00\">18h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>双盲测试 你在手绘一遍 AI 画的看看</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18109524\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/08d92793c67debd121be513cea9e4e10?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"momo1pm\" data-uid=\"360642\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/momo1pm\">momo1pm</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 12:01:58 +08:00\">18h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>50 万关注，阅读量 9000 ？这转化是不是太低了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18109533\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cbde672211929e66d05a343f24c495ae?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"insthesky\" data-uid=\"674720\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/insthesky\">insthesky</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 12:03:26 +08:00\">18h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>啊 真的吗 我现在都是 ai 生成的封面，自己实在是难做😭  不过流量确实不咋地</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18109618\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7bad/8a20/441003_normal.png?m=1716075803\" alt=\"ebushicao\" data-uid=\"441003\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ebushicao\">ebushicao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 12:34:27 +08:00\">17h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有一说一，你这几张 AI 图质量太差，至少我是没兴趣点进去的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18109681\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/75c8/2e17/437058_normal.png?m=1568193512\" alt=\"catning\" data-uid=\"437058\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/catning\">catning</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 12:57:00 +08:00\">17h 28m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我看到 AI 封面默认整篇都是 AI 生成的，反正我不会点进去，大部分 AI 生成的都是浪费时间的片汤话。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18109693\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fe53/517d/36358_normal.png?m=1488129252\" alt=\"Perry\" data-uid=\"36358\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Perry\">Perry</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 13:02:22 +08:00\">17h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>打印下来用手机拍了再上传试试看</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18109788\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ba03/8e2a/6834_normal.png?m=1733273843\" alt=\"hatw\" data-uid=\"6834\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hatw\">hatw</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 13:23:00 +08:00\">17h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>所有能看出 AI 的封面，都懒得点进去看</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18109835\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b73c/e398/160_normal.png?m=1786777290\" alt=\"dimlau\" data-uid=\"160\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dimlau\">dimlau</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 13:33:12 +08:00\">16h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>既然会限流，为什么微信自己又提供 ai 生成封面的功能？还真是矛盾啊。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18109838\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9b8a/01ea/462511_normal.png?m=1728647934\" alt=\"imxiaolong\" data-uid=\"462511\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/imxiaolong\">imxiaolong</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 13:34:30 +08:00\">16h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>现在看到 AI 味强的文章、图片，就有一种反胃的感觉</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110108\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1ac9/be13/420212_normal.png?m=1786001011\" alt=\"edgeedge\" data-uid=\"420212\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/edgeedge\">edgeedge</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:17:09 +08:00\">16h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>AIGC 图文类的，基本就是低质廉价、批量生成……的代名词了<br>AI 短视频门槛还高点，但因为 seedance 价格高，为解决成本，很多小瑕疵会不修</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110126\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0cd9/9b40/473965_normal.png?m=1789546794\" alt=\"klos\" data-uid=\"473965\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/klos\">klos</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:19:37 +08:00\">16h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>内容方面给不了指点<br>纯技术方面 你生成的图不直接用 用微信截图截一下 再上传 就除了暗水印这种东西都能规避了<br>@<a href=\"/member/liKeYunKeji\">liKeYunKeji</a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18110151\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/15ec4ee4bc03a08cc83ac3a3daa4840d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"imnotlxy\" data-uid=\"845263\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/imnotlxy\">imnotlxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-21 14:22:49 +08:00\">16h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用 AI 图作为封面的文章一般都是全篇 slop ，像楼主这样认真做内容的可能不多。最好别用 AI 图，不然读者根本不想点进去看。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"相当明显的限流！ 有什么能够让 ai 图不那么容易被识别的方法吗？或者对图片进行去隐形水印？ 限流 AI 封面20 replies • 2026-09-21 14:22:49 +08:00 3 Lexin914 19h 44m ago 国内有法规，ai 生成的图片 exif 元数据都加了特定的字段。可以再过一道其他图片编辑器 或 让 ai 专门写个脚本清理这个。 4 yulgang 19h 38m ago 对 ai 的图重新截图另存后上传截图看看 5 gsc 18h 28m ago 双盲测试 你在手绘一遍 AI 画的看看 6 momo1pm 18h 23m ago 50 万关注，阅读量 9000 ？这转化是不是太低了 7 insthesky 18h 22m ago 啊 真的吗 我现在都是 ai 生成的封面，自己实在是难做😭 不过流量确实不咋地 8 ebushicao 17h 51m ago 有一说一，你这几张 AI 图质量太差，至少我是没兴趣点进去的。 9 catning 17h 28m ago 1 我看到 AI 封面默认整篇都是 AI 生成的，反正我不会点进去，大部分 AI 生成的都是浪费时间的片汤话。 10 Perry 17h 23m ago 打印下来用手机拍了再上传试试看 11 hatw 17h 2m ago 所有能看出 AI 的封面，都懒得点进去看 12 dimlau 16h 52m ago 既然会限流，为什么微信自己又提供 ai 生成封面的功能？还真是矛盾啊。 13 imxiaolong 16h 51m ago 现在看到 AI 味强的文章、图片，就有一种反胃的感觉 17 edgeedge 16h 8m ago AIGC 图文类的，基本就是低质廉价、批量生成……的代名词了AI 短视频门槛还高点，但因为 seedance 价格高，为解决成本，很多小瑕疵会不修 19 klos 16h 6m ago 内容方面给不了指点纯技术方面 你生成的图不直接用 用微信截图截一下 再上传 就除了暗水印这种东西都能规避了@liKeYunKeji 20 imnotlxy 16h 2m ago 用 AI 图作为封面的文章一般都是全篇 slop ，像楼主这样认真做内容的可能不多。最好别用 AI 图，不然读者根本不想点进去看。","fetched_at":"2026-09-21T22:25:39.510Z","ok":true}